<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<br><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019487480" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000194876E0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019487940"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019487BA0" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019487E00" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019488060"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000194882C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019488520" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019488780" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000194889E0"><tr width="680" height="40px" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019488C40"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019488EA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019489810" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019489A70"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019489CD0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019489F30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img data_liveedit_tagid="CUSTOM107" border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/qantas-header-banner.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px; display: block;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948AE50" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948B0B0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948B310"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948B570" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948BA20"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948BC80"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948BEE0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948C140" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948C970"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948CBD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948D090"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948D2F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948D7B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948DA10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We hope this email finds you well.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002F8FFD30"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019975AB0">I’d like to inform you of a recent change within the Corporate Sales team at Qantas.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019975BC0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A87A6B0">This structural change has meant that <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Account Manager]</span>, has <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[decided to pursue opportunities outside of Qantas/moved on to another exciting role with the Group]</span>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A87A8F0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000199768B0">We are currently working through the process to appoint a new Account Manager who will be a dedicated resource for you, and will continue to provide the high level of service you expect from Qantas.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193B97D0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193B9A10">In the interim, if you have any questions, please contact us on 13 10 85 or via email at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:corporatedealingsupport@qantas.com.au" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A87F1F0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">corporatedealingsupport@qantas.com.au</a>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193B9B20"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193BA8C0">Thank you for your understanding and support during this transition period. We look forward to continuing our partnership with you.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948DED0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948E130" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019491FE0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019492240" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B0877D0">Maureen Chan Sau</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948A190">Team Leader<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001948EBE0">Qantas Corporate Sales<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019492810"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B087DA0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019492A50">Qantas Airways Limited</em><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019492DE0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019492EF0">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019493130">P. 13 10 85<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019493370">E.&nbsp;<a href="mailto:corporatedealingsupport@qantas.com.au" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A87C770" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">corporatedealingsupport@qantas.com.au</a></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019493810"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019493A70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019493F30"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019494190" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/footer/QF-oneworld-logo.png" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="304px" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000194943F0" style="display: block;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A2FFEE0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A300140" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A300600"><td border="0" hspace="0" vspace="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A300860" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A300AC0">Qantas Privacy Notice</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A2F7D20">Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13&nbsp;10&nbsp;85.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A3016A0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A301900" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001A301DC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019A12500" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019970A90"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019970CF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019970F50" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000199711B0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019971410"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019971670" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000199718D0" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019971B30"><tr width="680" height="40px" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019971D90"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019971FF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>